/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISIONS-SELECTION-TIME-APPROXIMATIONS-2026-09-08.md:7:3. **Two-stage scoring:** stage 1 = immediate score C1 + Ψ (interaction) for all catalogue rows on the coarse grid; stage 2 = C2 continuation (three offsets, batched) only for the top-M = 64 rows by stage-1 score plus BASE, the incumbents and every S0 proposal; the selected profile is the argmax of the complete score within that set. M is sealed.
