/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DESIGN-C3-PANEL-SPINE-2026-09-10.md:21:Running only under the sealed rule would measure the routes on a model that credits nothing on three quarters of its transmissions. Running only under the corrected rule would enact an unauthorised change to declared physics. Both is the only option that is neither.
