/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-OPEN-DECISION-ADDITIVE-SPLIT-2026-09-10.md-32-- the target module's decomposition and identity assertion;
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-OPEN-DECISION-ADDITIVE-SPLIT-2026-09-10.md-33-- the deployment scorer's additive-plus-interaction form;
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-OPEN-DECISION-ADDITIVE-SPLIT-2026-09-10.md-34-- the row label fields and both feature-schema digests, which are carried in every shard header and re-checked on read;
