/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-FIGURE1-AND-BACKOFF-2026-09-09.md-53-1. Whether the figure's QPSK-only table contradicts the priority declaration, or whether the note it was computed from, `V025-ANGLE-POWER-EE-NOTE-2026-09-08.md`, declares a QPSK-only model. That note is on the server and was not readable during this analysis. If the note and the declaration disagree, the declaration governs.
