/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md-4-## The owner's masking concern, answered
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md-5-The owner observed that a coordination layer sitting on top of a learned network re-scatters what was learned, so the learning effect cannot be seen. That is true, and this measurement establishes the reason it cannot simply be removed.
