/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md:7:Seeding the bounded joint catalogue from the **raw geometric assignment** instead of from the iterated unilateral fixed point recovers only **6.03 %** of the prefix's pooled uplift under the sealed rule and **4.99 %** under the corrected one. Against the geometric baseline the catalogue-only arm gains **+35.78 %** and **+21.63 %**, where the prefix gains **+593.06 %** and **+433.66 %**.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md-8-
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-PREFIX-IS-THE-VALUE-2026-09-10.md-9-**The raw geometric state does not expose a large one-catalogue learning band. The non-learned prefix creates almost all of it.**
