/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-SPAN-AND-C3-2026-09-10.md:14:My inference that the better unilateral endpoint would overtake the archived joint selector was correct — 30.7869 against 30.2814 under the sealed rule. But the joint selector re-seeded from that better endpoint overtakes it again, at **32.2045**. **Coordination is real, not an artefact of traversal order.**
